# Base URL of the apps/api Fastify service this portal talks to.
# Required -- the app throws on startup if this is unset.
ADMIN_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080

# Optional: enables the Aegis technical-context panel on ticket pages
# (src/lib/aegisSupportClient.ts). Both must be set together or the
# panel just renders "unavailable" -- no crash, nothing required.
# AEGIS_SUPPORT_READ_KEY must match Aegis's own COMMAND_CENTER_SUPPORT_READ_KEY.
# AEGIS_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8000
# AEGIS_SUPPORT_READ_KEY=
